    "de": [
      "Handgefertigte Seifenfabrik in Sénezergues in einem charmanten Dorf im Cantal.\r\nSoazig stellt handgemachte Seifen und Kosmetika aus natürlichen Zutaten her."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Artisanal soap factory located in Sénezergues, a charming village in the Cantal region.\r\nSoazig makes handcrafted soaps and cosmetics from natural ingredients."
    ],
